OL,3,AChrista Pike now walking after failed
OL,4,AUS execution, lawyer tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking late on Wednesday to BBC Radio
OL,7,F4's Today programme, lawyer Stephen
OL,8,FFerrell said he had not spoken to Pike
OL,9,Fdirectly but had learned her arms were
OL,10,Fswollen and barely functioning as she
OL,11,Ftook her first steps around her
OL,12,Fhospital room.
OL,14,FA court has ordered state officials to
OL,15,Fpreserve all evidence related to the
OL,16,Ffailed execution.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
